# DRAFT - tetgen static library + CLI tool hybrid Conan recipe

id:                     DRAFT-tetgen-1.6.0-static-library-plus-cli
trigger_tool:           conan create|package_type|commands.json
phase:                  design
error_signature:        Package type is 'library', but no 'shared' option declared|commands.json.*CLI|bindirs

severity:               2
category:               ohos, conan, packaging, recipe-design
match_keywords:         tetgen, static-library, libtet, CLI, bindirs, commands.json, package_type, shared option, cpp_info.libs
title:                  Recipe pattern for a package that ships both a static lib and a CLI tool

root_cause:             tetgen 1.6.0 produces both a static library (libtet.a) and a CLI executable (tetgen). Using package_type="library" requires a shared option; using "static-library" is correct for the pure-static upstream, but the CLI must still be exposed via cpp_info.bindirs and a software-level commands.json (R38). The library file is libtet.a, so cpp_info.libs must be ["tet"], not ["tetgen"].
affected_scope:         Conan 2 recipes for C/C++ libraries that also build a command-line front-end (e.g. tetgen, gts, gd).
verification_cmd:       CI_PACKAGES="archives/t/tetgen/1.6.0" zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           static-library-plus-cli
rec_description:        Set package_type="static-library" (no shared option needed); package the CLI into bin/; declare cpp_info.libs from the actual archive basename (libtet.a -> "tet"); add cpp_info.system_libs=["m"]; add cpp_info.bindirs=["bin"] and a software-level commands.json with type="tool" (R38). L0k then passes the CLI check and L2 smoke (--version) works.
rec_command:            conan create archives/t/tetgen/1.6.0 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      library-with-shared-option
fallback_description:   If the upstream actually supports shared builds, use package_type="library" plus options={"shared":[True,False]} and default_options={"shared":False}, mirroring gts/gd.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          conan-recipe

forbid_1_pattern:       package_type.*library.*without.*shared|libs.*tetgen
forbid_1_reason:        "library" without a shared option fails conan create; cpp_info.libs must match the archive name (libtet.a -> tet).
forbid_1_consequence:   conan create fails at dependency-graph computation, or consumers link -ltetgen which does not exist.
forbid_2_pattern:       omit.*commands.json.*cli|library.*type.*commands.json
forbid_2_reason:        R38: a package whose bin/ has content must ship a software-level commands.json; a pure library must not.
forbid_2_consequence:   L0k CLI check warns/fails, or the CLI is undiscoverable by hicmd.

principles:             P010,P014
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             E307
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

